  "description": "*Available NOW*\n\n***ONLINE ENQUIRIES ONLY****ONLINE ENQUIRIES ONLY***ONLINE ENQUIRIES ONLY***ONLINE ENQUIRIES ONLY*****ONLINE ENQUIRIES ONLY****\n\n**Please include details on your set, plus a phone number when replying or appointments will be missed***\n\nDublin Property Management are delighted to offer Griffith Hall to the rental market. This bright and spacious 2 bedroom, second floor apartment with a large full length balcony in this popular secure gated development ideally located off Glandore Road/Griffith Avenue.\n\nThere are two undergroud car parking spaces inculded in the rental price.\n\nThe beautifully proportioned accommodation includes an entrance hall, lounge/dining room with floor to ceiling windows and patio doors to balcony, integrated kitchen off the dining area, 2 bright bedrooms and fully tiled bathroom. The apartment has underfloor heating throughout.\n\nClose by are Drumcondra Village, Marino Institute of Education, DCU, Dublin Airport, Mater & Beaumont Hospitals, IFSC, East Point Business Park M1 and M50 motorways and the City Centre.",
